<title>UK: BCO BBA Creditanstalt prices $200 mln 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>BCO BBA Creditanstalt prices $200 mln 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Creditanstalt, Paribas and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BBA CREDITANSTALT (NASSAU BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     8.125     MATURITY   *25.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.45	REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+180 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BA/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT MAY 2000 U.S. TREASURY  NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>*CALL AND PUT OPTIONS 25.JUL.00 AT 99.04, 25.JUL.02 AT 99.20</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
